      "old_value": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"2da5ecc8-668f-4372-8583-6886b7fd3b81\">[GMCP-19] Demo MCP Tools 구현<br><br>Acceptance Criteria:<br>- read_file,send_email,web_request,db_query<br><br>Dependencies: GMCP-9<br>Reviewer: R4<br>Support: R1</p>",
